{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"All Falls Down","artist":"Alan Walker","date":"2026-08-04","sourceId":"14524675:033","sourceHash":"4d23b0092cdf91a491e777294dbc712cb52172613b6e328cd96ee8d746ca2797","duration":202.9,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.02712,"end":5.745,"text":"What's the trick?","translation":"무슨 비결이 있는 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.804989,"end":7.08,"text":"I wish I knew","translation":"나도 알았으면 좋겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":7.291066,"end":9.182,"text":"I'm so done with thinking through","translation":"생각하고 또 생각하는 것도 지긋지긋해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":9.241542,"end":11.76,"text":"All the things I could have been","translation":"내가 될 수도 있었던 모든 걸","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":11.923447,"end":13.953,"text":"And I know you wonder too","translation":"너도 궁금해한다는 걸 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":14.013243,"end":17.041,"text":"All it takes is that one look you do","translation":"네가 짓는 그 눈빛 한 번이면 충분해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":17.101497,"end":19.0,"text":"And I run right back to you","translation":"난 곧장 네게 돌아가","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":19.377052,"end":20.54,"text":"You crossed the line","translation":"넌 선을 넘었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":20.758639,"end":23.2,"text":"And it is time to say F Ü","translation":"이제 엿 먹으라고 할 때야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":24.717642,"end":26.86,"text":"What is the point in saying that","translation":"그런 말을 해 봐야 무슨 소용이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":27.213787,"end":28.791,"text":"When you know how I will react?","translation":"내가 어떻게 나올지 알면서","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":28.850794,"end":31.357,"text":"You think you can just take it back","translation":"그냥 되돌릴 수 있다고 생각하지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":31.416599,"end":33.771,"text":"But shit just do not work like that","translation":"하지만 세상일이 그렇게 되진 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":33.831474,"end":36.628,"text":"You're the drug that I'm addicted to","translation":"넌 내가 중독된 약이고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":36.687528,"end":38.601,"text":"And I want you so bad","translation":"난 네가 너무도 원해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":38.661224,"end":41.46,"text":"Guess I'm stuck with you","translation":"아마 네게 발이 묶였나 봐","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":41.575329,"end":42.78,"text":"And that's that","translation":"그게 다야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":43.758005,"end":46.124,"text":"'Cause when it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":46.18449,"end":47.6,"text":"Then whatever","translation":"그럼 어때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":48.471655,"end":53.311,"text":"When it don't work out for the better","translation":"좋은 쪽으로 풀리지 않을 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":53.371066,"end":55.935,"text":"If it just ain't right","translation":"그저 옳지 않다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":55.994921,"end":58.189,"text":"And it is time to say goodbye","translation":"이제 작별을 말해야 할 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":58.351746,"end":60.833,"text":"When it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":61.172971,"end":63.404,"text":"When it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":63.483356,"end":64.68,"text":"I'll be fine","translation":"난 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":68.046077,"end":69.62,"text":"I will be fine","translation":"나는 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":72.945488,"end":75.811,"text":"You're the drug that I'm addicted to","translation":"넌 내가 중독된 약이고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":75.871202,"end":77.913,"text":"And I want you so bad","translation":"난 네가 너무도 원해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":77.972608,"end":79.66,"text":"But I'll be fine","translation":"그래도 난 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":82.999728,"end":85.273,"text":"Why we fight? I don't know","translation":"왜 싸우는지 나도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":85.333333,"end":87.78,"text":"We say what hurts the most","translation":"우린 가장 아픈 말을 골라 해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":88.061678,"end":90.022,"text":"Oh, I tried staying cold","translation":"차갑게 있으려 했지만","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":90.081814,"end":92.204,"text":"But you take it personal","translation":"넌 그걸 개인적인 일로 받아들여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":92.26449,"end":95.525,"text":"All these firing shots and making ground","translation":"서로 쏘아붙이며 밀어붙이는 일","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":95.584943,"end":97.336,"text":"It's way too hard to cope","translation":"감당하기엔 너무 벅차","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":97.3961,"end":101.249,"text":"But I still can't let you go","translation":"그래도 널 놓지 못해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":101.308662,"end":104.906,"text":"'Cause when it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":104.965805,"end":106.36,"text":"Then whatever","translation":"그럼 어때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":107.74059,"end":112.081,"text":"When it don't work out for the better","translation":"좋은 쪽으로 풀리지 않을 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":112.140771,"end":114.948,"text":"If it just ain't right","translation":"그저 옳지 않다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":115.008435,"end":119.883,"text":"And it's time to say goodbye","translation":"이제 작별을 말해야 할 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":119.942676,"end":122.21,"text":"When it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":122.380771,"end":122.631,"text":"When it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":124.540227,"end":126.628,"text":"I'll be fine","translation":"난 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":126.688073,"end":128.5,"text":"I'll be fine","translation":"난 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":132.028662,"end":134.68,"text":"You're the drug that I'm addicted to","translation":"넌 내가 중독된 약이고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":134.780227,"end":136.706,"text":"And I want you so bad","translation":"난 네가 너무도 원해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":136.765533,"end":138.22,"text":"But I'll be fine","translation":"그래도 난 괜찮을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":141.815873,"end":144.809,"text":"I'll be fine, fine, fine","translation":"난 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":144.869297,"end":148.18,"text":"Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine","translation":"괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":151.022585,"end":152.082,"text":"I'll be fine, fine, fine","translation":"난 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":152.218413,"end":152.646,"text":"Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine I'll be fine, fine, fine","translation":"괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 난 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":152.706032,"end":156.375,"text":"Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine","translation":"괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":156.514104,"end":157.232,"text":"I'll be fine, fine, fine","translation":"난 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":157.291973,"end":160.076,"text":"Fine, fine, fine, fine, fine","translation":"괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아 괜찮아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":160.136417,"end":164.3,"text":"'Cause when it all falls down","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":164.687528,"end":166.566,"text":"Then whatever (then whatever, babe)","translation":"그럼 어때 그럼 어때 베이비","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":166.626395,"end":170.839,"text":"When it don't work out for the better (for the better)","translation":"좋은 쪽으로 풀리지 않을 때 좋은 쪽으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":170.898866,"end":174.06,"text":"If it just ain't right","translation":"그저 옳지 않다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":174.12644,"end":175.8,"text":"And it's time to say goodbye","translation":"이제 작별을 말해야 할 때","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":176.100136,"end":176.969,"text":"When it all falls down (when it all, when it all)","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때 모두 모두","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":177.028934,"end":180.974,"text":"When it all falls down (when it all falls down)","translation":"모든 게 무너져 내릴 때 모두 무너져 내릴 때","kind":"lyri